{"4754110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "INKUBO", "steam_appid": 4754110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4959260], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754110/extras/75ad47c411dbcba8f9ba763880eed125.avif?t=1788253276\" width=1281 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Eve has been suffering from long-term sleep problems, an inability to establish order in her life, psychological exhaustion, and recurring nightmares. Despite all the help and treatments she has received, she has not been able to overcome these issues, and as a last resort, she decides to undergo a strong medication treatment from her doctor, Dr. Isaac.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The pills given by Dr. Isaac will directly place Eve into the REM stage of sleep and keep her unconscious for hours. The only way for Eve to escape her nightmares is to confront them. After falling asleep, Eve finds herself inside a different-dimensional version of her own home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Realizing that no matter where she goes, she is trapped in an endless loop, Eve understands that the only way out is to find the anomalies in her house, survive them, and make the correct decisions. If Eve manages to make a series of correct choices without a single mistake, she will escape the loop… or so she thinks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>STUCK IN A LOOP WITH ANOMALIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eve has no chance but to face her nightmares and make the right decisions to break the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the anomalies such as missing objects, extra objects, changed objects, entities, extraordinary events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making the right decision doesn't always mean there are anomalies. Every loop has its own chance to spawn or not spawn anomalies. Keep your eyes open to notice the differences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754110/extras/542186bd8a8a8a1f6e288eb96eb02619.poster.avif?t=1788253276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754110/extras/542186bd8a8a8a1f6e288eb96eb02619.webm?t=1788253276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754110/extras/542186bd8a8a8a1f6e288eb96eb02619.mp4?t=1788253276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SURVIVE THE ENTITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not always alone and you'll never be. Survive the entities that are trying to kill you during your loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can make some entities lose your track by hiding. But not all of them are going to give you that chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754110/extras/9616d5a7f43d6b5376e03a27fea5458c.poster.avif?t=1788253276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754110/extras/9616d5a7f43d6b5376e03a27fea5458c.webm?t=1788253276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754110/extras/9616d5a7f43d6b5376e03a27fea5458c.mp4?t=1788253276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR CHALLENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">INKUBO comes with 3 different difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EASY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NORMAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HARD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every difficulty level has its own terms. Pick the one that suits you and break the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754110/extras/533f7bc9b00a423eb26535b37c66dc63.avif?t=1788253276\" width=1280 height=87 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience this depressive story of a girl who lives at home alone with sleeping problems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different. INKUBO doesn't depend on chained events and every event/anomaly has their own chances to appear in your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INKUBO uses High Definition Render Pipeline (HDRP) to deliver high-quality visual horror experience and atmosphere with realtime lighting features.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754110/extras/75ad47c411dbcba8f9ba763880eed125.avif?t=1788253276\" width=1281 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Eve has been suffering from long-term sleep problems, an inability to establish order in her life, psychological exhaustion, and recurring nightmares. Despite all the help and treatments she has received, she has not been able to overcome these issues, and as a last resort, she decides to undergo a strong medication treatment from her doctor, Dr. Isaac.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The pills given by Dr. Isaac will directly place Eve into the REM stage of sleep and keep her unconscious for hours. The only way for Eve to escape her nightmares is to confront them. After falling asleep, Eve finds herself inside a different-dimensional version of her own home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Realizing that no matter where she goes, she is trapped in an endless loop, Eve understands that the only way out is to find the anomalies in her house, survive them, and make the correct decisions. If Eve manages to make a series of correct choices without a single mistake, she will escape the loop… or so she thinks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>STUCK IN A LOOP WITH ANOMALIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eve has no chance but to face her nightmares and make the right decisions to break the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the anomalies such as missing objects, extra objects, changed objects, entities, extraordinary events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making the right decision doesn't always mean there are anomalies. Every loop has its own chance to spawn or not spawn anomalies. Keep your eyes open to notice the differences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754110/extras/542186bd8a8a8a1f6e288eb96eb02619.poster.avif?t=1788253276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754110/extras/542186bd8a8a8a1f6e288eb96eb02619.webm?t=1788253276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754110/extras/542186bd8a8a8a1f6e288eb96eb02619.mp4?t=1788253276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SURVIVE THE ENTITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not always alone and you'll never be. Survive the entities that are trying to kill you during your loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can make some entities lose your track by hiding. But not all of them are going to give you that chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754110/extras/9616d5a7f43d6b5376e03a27fea5458c.poster.avif?t=1788253276\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754110/extras/9616d5a7f43d6b5376e03a27fea5458c.webm?t=1788253276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754110/extras/9616d5a7f43d6b5376e03a27fea5458c.mp4?t=1788253276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR CHALLENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">INKUBO comes with 3 different difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EASY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>NORMAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HARD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every difficulty level has its own terms. Pick the one that suits you and break the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754110/extras/533f7bc9b00a423eb26535b37c66dc63.avif?t=1788253276\" width=1280 height=87 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience this depressive story of a girl who lives at home alone with sleeping problems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different. INKUBO doesn't depend on chained events and every event/anomaly has their own chances to appear in your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INKUBO uses High Definition Render Pipeline (HDRP) to deliver high-quality visual horror experience and atmosphere with realtime lighting features.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Eve, who suffers from sleep issues and nightmares, takes pills from Dr. Isaac that put her into REM sleep. She becomes trapped in a loop inside a distorted, other-dimensional version of her own home. She must find anomalies, make the right choices, and survive deadly entities to break the cycle.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754110/c7f3a7ae7d29d2b13586f4c283581c57d94dd8df/header.jpg?t=1788253276", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754110/73a775542249df4589aa0cd64d12aecf37b9025c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788253276", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4754110/73a775542249df4589aa0cd64d12aecf37b9025c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788253276", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 2600/Intel Core i5-10400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li